# Example: if as an expression

C-like if/else. Both branches required. The value of the if is the value of the chosen branch.

## Schema

```
Ball = Int/x Int/y Int/dx Int/dy Int/rad
```

## Construction

```
[:Ball 100 100 -3 1 5]
```

## Methods

```
Ball::absDx = {
  if (dx < 0) { -dx } else { dx }
}
```

## Target

```
%main
public static function main():Void {
    var assemblage = ballFactory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(assemblage.toConstruction(0, helper));
    trace("absDx");
    trace(assemblage.absDx());
}
```
